  "tempo": 1.12,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Your jeans have a pocket designed for a gadget from the 1800s. That",
      "start": 0.058,
      "end": 4.192
    },
    {
      "text": "tiny pocket inside the front pocket wasn't originally for coins, AirPods, or",
      "start": 4.193,
      "end": 8.456
    },
    {
      "text": "whatever else you can barely fit inside it.",
      "start": 8.456,
      "end": 10.296
    },
    {
      "text": "Early Levi's jeans included it as a watch pocket.",
      "start": 10.626,
      "end": 13.217
    },
    {
      "text": "Pocket watches were common, and workers needed a small, protected place to keep",
      "start": 13.525,
      "end": 17.136
    },
    {
      "text": "them. Wristwatches eventually took over. The pocket watch mostly disappeared, but",
      "start": 17.136,
      "end": 21.488
    },
    {
      "text": "the pocket survived.",
      "start": 21.488,
      "end": 22.435
    },
    {
      "text": "So that useless little compartment on your jeans is basically a tiny fossil from a",
      "start": 22.76,
      "end": 26.993
    },
    {
      "text": "technology nobody carries anymore.",
      "start": 26.993,
      "end": 28.761
    }
  ],
